某学校举办“校园演讲比赛”,每位选手由8位评委打分(分数为0~10的整数),且每位评委必须打分。计分规则:去掉一个最高分,去掉一个最低分。如下程序通过键盘先输入选手编号,然后依次输入8个分数,并计算最终得分。下列说法正确的是()。
```cpp
1 for (int i = 0; i < 10; i++) {
2     int id, score;
3     printf("输入选手编号:");
4     scanf("%d", &id);
5     int max_score = 0, min_score = 100; // 最高分和最低分
6     int total_score = 0; // 总分
7     for (int j = 1; j < 9; j++) {
8         printf("输入选手第%d个成绩:",j);
9         scanf("%d", &score);
10        if (max_score < score)
11            max_score = score;
12        if (min_score > score)
13            min_score = score;
14        total_score += score;
15    }
16    total_score = total_score - max_score - min_score;
17    printf("%d号选手的成绩:\n", id);
18    printf("去掉一个最高分%d,\n", max_score);
19    printf("去掉一个最低分%d,\n", min_score);
20    printf("最后成绩是:%d", total_score);
21 }
```

options.text:
`total_score = total_score - max_score - min_score` 不能达到预期,可修改如下:
```cpp
1 int total = total_score - max_score - min_score;
2 total_score = total;
```
